{"number":81,"title":"M4: Jev client with a local fallback","state":"OPEN","labels":[{"name":"waiting-on-jake"}],"comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOVESb688AAAABbA8aUA","author":{"login":"jparker2006"},"body":"Building: taking this (Claude)","createdAt":"2026-10-11T10:07:09Z","url":"https://github.com/jparker2006/lexicon/issues/81#issuecomment-6107896400"},{"id":"IC_kwDOVESb688AAAABbBET4w","author":{"login":"jparker2006"},"body":"Ready for review: PR #113","createdAt":"2026-10-11T10:21:45Z","url":"https://github.com/jparker2006/lexicon/issues/81#issuecomment-6108025827"},{"id":"IC_kwDOVESb688AAAABbBGPig","author":{"login":"jparker2006"},"body":"Merged in #113. Kept open: the live warm round trip criterion is unmeasured, waiting on Jake's go-ahead for a few synthetic-text TypeSafe calls.","createdAt":"2026-10-11T10:25:51Z","url":"https://github.com/jparker2006/lexicon/issues/81#issuecomment-6108057482"},{"id":"IC_kwDOVESb688AAAABbBH42A","author":{"login":"jparker2006"},"body":"Live Jev measurement (Jake approved): p50 meets the criterion, p95 is inconclusive. One run of 20 warm calls gave p95 383 ms, against ~215 ms expected, on a loaded Mac.","createdAt":"2026-10-11T10:29:28Z","url":"https://github.com/jparker2006/lexicon/issues/81#issuecomment-6108084440"},{"id":"IC_kwDOVESb688AAAABbBH-dA","author":{"login":"jparker2006"},"body":"Orchestrator: p50 meets. p95 is inconclusive because the machine was at load 10 on 10 cores. Rerun about 20 calls when the Mac is quiet (planned for the gap between M0 and M1, Jake's yes asked in that session). Keep the 250 ms budget until then. Stays open.","createdAt":"2026-10-11T10:29:40Z","url":"https://github.com/jparker2006/lexicon/issues/81#issuecomment-6108085876"}],"createdAt":"2026-10-11T05:29:01Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-11T10:29:40Z","closedAt":null,"url":"https://github.com/jparker2006/lexicon/issues/81","body":""},
