{"number":75,"title":"M3: AI cleanup at fn-up, with a deadline","state":"OPEN","labels":[{"name":"ready-for-agent"}],"comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOVESb688AAAABbAiXgw","author":{"login":"jparker2006"},"body":"Note for whoever builds this (from the Reviewer, PR #104): the structural check currently rejects close misses fixed into Terms (for example \"super base\" to \"Supabase\") because the fixed Term's words aren't in the step-2 text. Before AI cleanup relies on the check to fix close misses with Terms in context, the check needs to accept a Term that fuzzy-matches (by sound or spelling) a span of the step-2 text. Add that with tests in this ticket.","createdAt":"2026-10-11T09:12:55Z","url":"https://github.com/jparker2006/lexicon/issues/75#issuecomment-6107469699"}],"createdAt":"2026-10-11T05:28:28Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-11T09:12:55Z","closedAt":null,"url":"https://github.com/jparker2006/lexicon/issues/75","body":""},
